schema: "0.3"
id: echo-of-manifestation-map-shattered-observatory
type: image
service: gemini

prompt:
  text: >
    Top-down dungeon map of the Shattered Observatory — Zone 5 of Echo of Manifestation, a survival
    horror roguelite. Dark fantasy game design document style, bird's-eye architectural floor plan.

    The map shows a broken astronomical facility with inverted physics, featuring gravity anomaly
    zones and zero-gravity pockets throughout:

    ENTRY (west): A freight lift shaft from Zone 4's threshold corridor. The lift platform drawn at
    an angle to suggest the journey through layers. Small resonance shrine on a tilted pedestal.

    FRAGMENTED STAR GALLERY — COMBAT (center-west): 18m x 14m gallery of broken telescopes and
    shattered star charts. Sections of floor drawn at different orientations — some rotated 15-30
    degrees, some tilted (indicated by perspective lines). Floating debris shown as objects with
    motion trails suggesting zero-gravity drift. Two essence nodes: attached to a floating star chart,
    embedded in a tilted wall section. Three shadow nodes: inside telescope housings, among floating
    debris, behind inverted floor panel. GRAVITY FLUX ZONES marked with rotating arrows and a 20-second
    cycle timer — random 4m x 4m sections shift orientation. Transmutation circles etched on the floor
    shown as geometric arcane symbols.

    ORRERY CALIBRATION CHAMBER — PUZZLE (center): 14m x 14m. A massive orrery dominates center drawn
    as concentric orbital rings with celestial body icons. Three control pedestals marked as
    interaction points. Star chart on ceiling shown as a dotted overlay pattern. One essence node at
    center of orrery (accessible only after alignment). Two shadow nodes orbiting with celestial
    bodies. Celestial collision hazard zones marked as impact trajectory lines.

    LENS FORGE WORKSHOP — LOOT (east): 12m x 10m abandoned lens-grinding workshop. Crystalline lens
    fragments on workbenches. A reinforced optic vault in corner. Three essence nodes: optic vault,
    workbench lens pile, polishing station. One shadow node trapped inside a large focusing lens.
    FOCUSED LIGHT BEAMS shown as amber laser lines crossing the room from misaligned lens fragments.
    A TIME DILATION POCKET inside the optic vault behind a false back panel.

    CELESTIAL ARCHIVE — SECRET (accessible through broken telescope aperture in Star Gallery): 10m x 18m
    hidden archive drawn with dashed border. Star charts and observation logs on floating shelves shown
    as hovering rectangular shapes. A resonance telescope at far end shown as a special lens icon.
    Two essence nodes: archive shelves, resonance telescope. Two shadow nodes concealed in star chart
    rolls. ZERO-GRAVITY ZONE at center marked with a floating figure icon and no-floor indicator.
    The resonance telescope reveals a scrying-eye icon that shows all secret room entrances.

    THE ASTROLABE APEX — BOSS (north): 20m x 20m observatory peak chamber open to fractured sky
    (shown as void-starfield background at edges). A giant astrolabe at center drawn as a rotating
    ring instrument with cardinal markers. Transparent star map floor with visible void beneath
    (shown as a dark void layer below a transparent floor layer). Three essence nodes on astrolabe
    arms (move with rotation). Five shadow nodes: embedded in astrolabe structure, below floor in
    void, at star map constellation points. Astrolabe sweep hazard shown as rotating blade indicators.
    Void floor crack zones marked as danger areas. A TIME DILATION POCKET at the star map north
    point. Boss marker: "CRUCIBLE ELEMENTAL" with an element-cycling icon (fire/water/earth/air).
    ELEMENTAL STATE SHIFT ZONES marked as colored floor sections cycling through the four elements.

    The gravity inversion mechanic is shown throughout with directional indicators on corridors —
    some corridors have "UP" arrows meaning the player traverses on the ceiling. Zero-gravity pockets
    shown as blank circular zones where orientation is undefined.

    Map legend: Amber diamond = Essence Node, Purple circle = Shadow Node, Golden bubble = Time
    Dilation Pocket, Dashed border = Secret Room, Skull icon = Boss, Rotating arrows = Gravity Flux,
    Blank circle = Zero-Gravity Pocket, Colored floor = Elemental State Zone.

    Style: Architectural blueprint on deep space purple-black background. Room walls in brass-colored
    lines with fractured starlight accents. Wrong constellations visible as background pattern.
    Gravity anomalies rendered as tilted/rotated room sections. Telescopes and orrery drawn with
    scientific instrument precision mixed with arcane symbols. Professional game design document
    aesthetic with cosmic horror undertones.
  negative: "bright colors, cartoon, anime, 3D rendered, photorealistic, normal gravity, standard architecture, cheerful, colorful, realistic starfield, low detail"

output:
  formats:
    - format: png
  dimensions:
    width: 1536
    height: 1536
    aspect_ratio: "1:1"

tags: [map, zone-5, shattered-observatory, top-down, dungeon-map, game-design-document, dark-fantasy, zero-gravity]
